    "notes": {
        "02088594-c102-42cd-85d3-273db6d935b7": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 1424,
            "width": 760,
            "height": 330,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data: one prepared Telegram contact\n\nThis flow does not create contacts. It finds the contact whose Text custom field **appmixer_e2e** is **e2e-contact**.\nOne-time setup on the Manychat test account:\n\n1. Settings → Channels → connect Telegram with the bot **@AppmixerManychatBot** (token in appmixer-test-credentials).\n2. Settings → Fields → New User Field: name **appmixer_e2e**, type **Text**.\n3. In Telegram, open @AppmixerManychatBot and press Start. In Manychat → Contacts open that contact and set **appmixer_e2e** = **e2e-contact**.\n\nTelegram has no 24-hour messaging window, so the contact keeps working without re-messaging.\n\nEach run sets the contact's last name to the run's tag name (E2E Subscriber Tag <timestamp>)."
        }
    }
